17. Expanded Force Majeure
Section FM – Force Majeure (Revised)
Force Majeure includes:
EAC grid connection delays
Cyprus governmental/permit delays
Environmental/archaeological work stoppages
Changes to renewable energy regulations
Pandemic restrictions
Delays in financing outside parties’ control
All deadlines extend automatically; no penalties apply. If FM persists >6 months, either party may pause obligations (not terminate). Anti-circumvention protections remain active during FM.

18. Market Price Protection
Section MP – Market Price Protection
• Linyang shall maintain Cyprus pricing competitive with comparable EU distributors (±5%).• If Distributor demonstrates Linyang pricing >10% above equivalent competitor products, Linyang shall:
(a) adjust the price, or
(b) release Distributor from non-compete obligations for the affected product category.

